# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Thunderbird — files that never belong in the repo
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Render output & image sequences ---------------------------------------
# Renders are reproducible from the scene files. Keeping them out is what
# stops this repo from blowing through GitHub's LFS storage quota.
# The folder is kept in the repo (via .gitkeep) but its contents never are.
/renders/*
!/renders/.gitkeep
/output/
/comps/output/
**/playblasts/
**/*.playblast
**/Preview/

# --- Simulation & render caches --------------------------------------------
**/cache/
**/caches/
**/*_cache/
*.bphys
*.bobj.gz
*.sim
*.nCache
*.pdc
*.mcfp

# --- Maya -------------------------------------------------------------------
*.ma.swatches
*.mb.swatches
**/incrementalSave/
mayaLog
mayaRender*.log
*.ma.[0-9][0-9]*
*.mb.[0-9][0-9]*

# --- 3ds Max ----------------------------------------------------------------
*.max.bak
*.bak
autoback/
*.hold

# --- Cinema 4D --------------------------------------------------------------
*.c4d~
**/tex/
**/illum/

# --- After Effects / Premiere ----------------------------------------------
# AE auto-save copies and disk cache — regenerated, never share them.
**/Adobe\ After\ Effects\ Auto-Save/
**/Adobe\ Premiere\ Pro\ Auto-Save/
*.aep.bk[0-9]
*Auto-Save*/
**/*.cfa
**/*.pek
**/*.prpreview
Peak\ Files/
Media\ Cache/
Media\ Cache\ Files/
Adobe\ Premiere\ Pro\ Preview\ Files/
Adobe\ Premiere\ Pro\ Captured\ Video/
Adobe\ Premiere\ Pro\ Audio\ Previews/

# --- macOS ------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Icon?

# --- Windows (for collaborators on PC) --------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# --- Editors ----------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
/Test/TbirdSlideTest
